   "updated": 1748000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Search order for solution 1 (row, col):  (0,1) -> (1,3) -> (2,0) -> (3,2)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "originalText": "Search order for solution 1 (row, col):  (0,1) -> (1,3) -> (2,0) -> (3,2)",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "Rp324nkQni5B",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 120,
   "y": 500,
   "width": 792.0000000000001,
   "height": 108.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1511967896,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2019254916,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1748000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Pruning in action:\n(0,0) -> row 1 has NO safe square (c0 col, c1 diag, c2 diag, c3 diag)\n-> abandon the whole subtree immediately.\n(0,1) -> row 1 only allows c3 -> row 2 only allows c0 -> row 3 only allows c2 -> SOLUTION.\n(0,2) -> mirrors to solution 2.  (0,3) -> dead end like (0,0).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "originalText": "Pruning in action:\n(0,0) -> row 1 has NO safe square (c0 col, c1 diag, c2 diag, c3 diag)\n-> abandon the whole subtree immediately.\n(0,1) -> row 1 only allows c3 -> row 2 only allows c0 -> row 3 only allows c2 -> SOLUTION.\n(0,2) -> mirrors to solution 2.  (0,3) -> dead end like (0,0).",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
